00:26:19.788 --> 00:26:21.205
Sarah?

00:26:21.206 --> 00:26:22.790
Apakah kamu di atas tangga?

00:26:22.791 --> 00:26:23.958
Eh… Ya.

00:26:23.959 --> 00:26:25.711
Belok kiri. Lihat di sepanjang dinding.

00:26:26.503 --> 00:26:28.087
Ada banyak dinding.

00:26:28.088 --> 00:26:29.590
Cari bagian yang ada pita di atasnya.

00:26:30.299 --> 00:26:33.051
Di sisi kiri, setinggi pinggul,
