00:26:39.892 --> 00:26:42.227
Hai.

00:26:42.936 --> 00:26:44.897
Kamar ini bagus.

00:26:46.064 --> 00:26:47.149
Terima kasih.

00:26:47.733 --> 00:26:49.400
